pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primary"
elements:
  - elementId: bg-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 700, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>项目背景与核心痛点</p>

  - elementId: bg-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 88, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: bg-card1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 560, 130]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: bg-icon1
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 125, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:circle-exclamation"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: bg-card1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [118, 122, 480, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>笔记效率低</strong></p>

  - elementId: bg-card1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [118, 155, 480, 70]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text_secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>课堂听讲时手动记笔记效率低，容易遗漏重点，且无法兼顾听讲与记录</p>

  - elementId: bg-card2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 110, 560, 130]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: bg-icon2
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [680, 125, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:file-powerpoint"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent_blue"}

  - elementId: bg-card2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [718, 122, 480, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>PPT 内容难定位</strong></p>

  - elementId: bg-card2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [718, 155, 480, 70]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text_secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>课后复习时难以快速定位 PPT 对应内容，课件与笔记处于割裂状态</p>

  - elementId: bg-card3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 260, 560, 130]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: bg-icon3
