    bounds: [60, 440, 120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>解决方案</p>

  - elementId: bg-solution-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 480, 1160, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Nootbook</strong> 定位：覆盖 <span style="color:$accent;">听课 → 转录 → 对齐 → 复习 → 测验</span> 的完整学习闭环，将 AI 能力深度融入每个环节</p>

